"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5745073720","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123626#issuecomment-5745073720","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123626","id":5745073720,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVm7eOA","user":{"login":"CambalacheG","id":219189972,"node_id":"U_kgDODRCS1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219189972?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CambalacheG","html_url":"https://github.com/CambalacheG","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CambalacheG/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CambalacheG/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CambalacheG/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CambalacheG/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CambalacheG/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CambalacheG/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CambalacheG/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CambalacheG/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CambalacheG/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-19T20:29:31Z","updated_at":"2026-09-19T20:29:31Z","body":"I had exactly the same problem; it's better to disable texture streaming or SDFGI. It is a dev build, after all.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5745073720/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5749575651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123626#issuecomment-5749575651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123626","id":5749575651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVrOP4w","user":{"login":"malhotraprateek","id":10957697,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTU3Njk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10957697?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/malhotraprateek","html_url":"https://github.com/malhotraprateek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malhotraprateek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malhotraprateek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malhotraprateek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malhotraprateek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malhotraprateek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malhotraprateek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malhotraprateek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malhotraprateek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/malhotraprateek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-20T11:42:30Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T14:51:32Z","body":"Investigated this using claude.\n\nSeems like ```RenderForwardClustered::_setup_render_pass_uniform_set``` was modified a couple of weeks ago to implement screen space contact shadows.\nIt was assigned a binding of 37 and binding for storage buffer was changed to 38.\nIn ```RenderForwardClustered::_setup_sdfgi_render_pass_uniform_set``` though, binding 37 is still being used for the storage buffer.\n\nI was able to create a custom build by applying the following modification in ```RenderForwardClustered::_setup_sdfgi_render_pass_uniform_set```.\n\n```\n\t{\n\t\tRD::Uniform u;\n\t\tu.binding = 37;    // Change this to 38\n\t\tu.uniform_type = RD::UNIFORM_TYPE_STORAGE_BUFFER;\n\t\tRID instance_buffer = scene_shader.default_material_feedback_buffer;\n\t\tu.append_id(instance_buffer);\n\t\tuniforms.push_back(u);\n\t}\n```\n\n**_NOTE: I am not sure if this modification is the proper way of fixing this issue. I defer to Godot maintainers for the correct fix._**","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5749575651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"low-quality"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5750542544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123626#issuecomment-5750542544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123626","id":5750542544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVsJQ0A","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-20T14:52:24Z","updated_at":"2026-09-20T14:52:24Z","body":"Cc @Rudolph-B ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5750542544/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]